WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.430
1. Act as Alice Koopa

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:08.397
2. Search games: Mario

00:00:08.397 --> 00:00:11.280
3. Open Super Mario 64

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.163
4. Rank by runs

00:00:14.163 --> 00:00:17.050
5. Switch board to 100%

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.934
6. Switch board to Any%

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:25.029
7. Search runner: DashMain

00:00:25.029 --> 00:00:28.281
8. Open DashMain run (splits + history)

00:00:28.281 --> 00:00:31.146
9. Back to the SM64 board

00:00:31.146 --> 00:00:34.030
10. Show pending runs on the board

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:36.914
11. Hide approved (work still needing input)

00:00:36.914 --> 00:00:38.914
12. Return to the games list
